WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
GECKOGuard's network list. Tap on Wipkingen Airport Free.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:11.000
GECKOGuard joins the network, looks up what is registered here, and follows the login page.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
"Don't use this network": the login page is not the one registered here.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.200
What GECKO saw: the unregistered domain, and the map's answer with valid proofs.
